      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WAVE OF FUN (1) had a tricky draw and ran well to finish third, beaten 1.5 lengths, (22.77) at this track. Has performed well from this box with a win and five minor placings to her name from eight starts. Racing well and deserves a win. THUMANI (4) scored two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 13 length 6th at Cannington (30.86). Has a strong record out of this box with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Better than last start and can bounce back. INTIMIDATION (2) copped a check in the run finishing out of the placings when a 62 length eighth (34.35) in a Grade 4/5 at Cannington. Can measure up this time. FEDERAL FOCUS (3) was out of placings last time (22.99) at this track in a Grade 4, finishing fourth and beaten 5 lengths. Has already won three times from this draw.",
